  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bb22299b1541e184bbaaba69206c4d2d, type: 3}
  m_Name: LT-2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MonologueLines
  textLines:
  - Another memory crept into the priestesses mind.
  - While she was praying for the administrator they started seeing each other.
  - She told her of accounting the gain and of the meaningless squabbles people fought over and of the little everyday things.
  - And the priestess listened and the priestess laughed.
  - While failing not to stare at the one she was falling for.
